arning channels promptly. Preserve timestamps and source provenance when safe; do not delay protective action to collect data.\",\"schemaVersion\":1,\"significance\":\"The combined observations meet the supplied policy for an extremely high precautionary threat posture. A possible looming attack warrants urgent protective attention; timing does not prove a shared cause.\"}","role":"assistant"}],"promptSha256":"ec20b0efe25436101ab5d6823866ba00360b6fd39d3d891e1e07f95929bec79e","source":{"id":"layertime-civilian-warning-v1","kind":"synthetic","labelAuthor":"AI-assisted project policy; not independently field validated","permission":"Project-authored development curriculum","reference":"Authored camp scenario ontoforge-credible-sequence-1","trainingAllowed":true},"split":"train"}
