orted event with source, place, time and uncertainty.\",\"signal_identity\":\"Generic RF energy is not confirmed drone identification.\",\"source_independence\":\"Separate reports are not independent when they derive from one observation.\",\"spatial_overlap\":\"Locations overlap within the supplied measurement uncertainty.\",\"temporal_precedence\":\"Event A precedes B only if their uncertainty intervals do not overlap.\",\"warning_posture\":\"Precautionary urgency under a named policy; not probability of attack.\"},\"relations\":[{\"object\":\"causal_claim\",\"predicate\":\"distinctFrom\",\"subject\":\"warning_posture\"},{\"object\":\"temporal_precedence\",\"predicate\":\"requiresMoreThan\",\"subject\":\"causal_claim\"},{\"object\":\"observation\",\"predicate\":\"qualifies\",\"subject\":\"source_independence\"},{\"object\":\"warning_posture\",\"predicate\":\"constrains\",\"subject\":\"signal_identity\"}]}\nReturn JSON matching: {\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"factReferences\":{\"items\":{\"enum\":[\"capture_summary\",\"event_sequence\",\"capture_context\",\"review_policy\"]},\"minItems\":1,\"type\":\"array\",\"uniqueItems\":true},\"headline\":{\"maxLength\":240,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"limitations\":{\"maxLength\":600,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"passiveNextStep\":{\"maxLength\":500,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"schemaVersion\":{\"const\":1},\"significance\":{\"maxLength\":800,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"schemaVersion\",\"headline\",\"significance\",\"limitations\",\"passiveNextStep\",\"factReferences\"],\"type\":\"object\"}","role":"system"},{"content":"{\"facts\": [{\"factId\": \"capture_summary\", \"value\": {\"context\": \"Synthetic refugee camp under a supplied credible ongoing threat from an oppressive regime; this is context, not actor attribution.\", \"disruption\": {\"kind\": \"credible independently reviewed deliberate Wi-Fi denial of service\", \"location\": \"camp-area\", \"so