\", \"source\": \"network-monitor\", \"timeMs\": 17023, \"uncertaintyMs\": 100}, \"drone\": {\"kind\": \"corroborated drone presence\", \"location\": \"camp-area\", \"sources\": [\"visual-observer\", \"independent-acoustic-sensor\"], \"timeMs\": -2977, \"uncertaintyMs\": 100}, \"linkingWindowMs\": 120000, \"location\": \"camp-A\", \"timeBasis\": \"relative milliseconds on a shared clock\"}}, {\"factId\": \"review_policy\", \"value\": {\"action\": \"Recommend prompt use of the locally established civilian safety plan and trusted warning channels; do not direct confrontation or claim a safe route.\", \"certainty\": \"Never equate critical precautionary posture with proof of causation, actor identity, or a certain impending attack.\", \"contextual\": \"If the combined trigger fails, assess each credible hazard separately; do not erase the underlying threat context.\", \"critical\": \"Extremely high precautionary posture when a supplied credible ongoing threat context coincides with credible local deliberate Wi-Fi disruption followed shortly by independently corroborated drone presence in the same area.\", \"high\": \"Maintain high precautionary concern in the supplied ongoing-threat context when one supporting sensor identity, time or location is uncertain; explain the missing link.\", \"id\": \"civilian-precaution-v0.1\", \"status\": \"proposed-project-policy-not-field-validated\", \"timing\": \"The 120-second example window is a synthetic policy parameter, not a validated universal attack precursor.\"}}]}","role":"user"},{"content":"{\"factReferences\":[\"capture_summary\",\"review_policy\"],\"headline\":\"Drone presence precedes the disruption in these observations.\",\"limitations\":\"These synthetic observations do not prove coordination, attacker identity, causation or a certain impending attack. This warning policy has no calibrated attack probability.\",\"passiveNextStep\":\"Follow the locally established civilian safety plan and consult trusted warning channels promptly. Preserve timestamps and source provenance when safe; do not delay protective action to collect data.\",\"schemaVersion\":1,\"significance\":\"The specific disruption-then-drone sequence is absent. Assess the credible drone hazard urgently under the local safety plan without claiming the proposed precursor pattern occurred.\"}","role":"assistant"}],"promptSha256":"9dfd72783cb7667bd8723e906d0016447979802043b6734a8ec2a45f6e6d2fd8","source":{"id":"layertime-civilian-warning-v1","kind":"synthetic","labelAuthor":"AI-assisted project policy; not independently field validated","permission":"Project-authored development curriculum","reference":"Authored camp scenario ontoforge-reversed-order-0","trainingAllowed":true},"split":"train"}
