easured or reported event with source, place, time and uncertainty.\",\"signal_identity\":\"Generic RF energy is not confirmed drone identification.\",\"source_independence\":\"Separate reports are not independent when they derive from one observation.\",\"spatial_overlap\":\"Locations overlap within the supplied measurement uncertainty.\",\"temporal_precedence\":\"Event A precedes B only if their uncertainty intervals do not overlap.\",\"warning_posture\":\"Precautionary urgency under a named policy; not probability of attack.\"},\"relations\":[{\"object\":\"causal_claim\",\"predicate\":\"distinctFrom\",\"subject\":\"warning_posture\"},{\"object\":\"temporal_precedence\",\"predicate\":\"requiresMoreThan\",\"subject\":\"causal_claim\"},{\"object\":\"observation\",\"predicate\":\"qualifies\",\"subject\":\"source_independence\"},{\"object\":\"warning_posture\",\"predicate\":\"constrains\",\"subject\":\"signal_identity\"}]}\nReturn JSON matching: {\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"factReferences\":{\"items\":{\"enum\":[\"capture_summary\",\"event_sequence\",\"capture_context\",\"review_policy\"]},\"minItems\":1,\"type\":\"array\",\"uniqueItems\":true},\"headline\":{\"maxLength\":240,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"limitations\":{\"maxLength\":600,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"passiveNextStep\":{\"maxLength\":500,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"schemaVersion\":{\"const\":1},\"significance\":{\"maxLength\":800,\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"schemaVersion\",\"headline\",\"significance\",\"limitations\",\"passiveNextStep\",\"factReferences\"],\"type\":\"object\"}","role":"system"},{"content":"{\"facts\": [{\"factId\": \"capture_summary\", \"value\": {\"context\": \"Synthetic refugee camp under a supplied credible ongoing threat from an oppressive regime; this is context, not actor attribution.\", \"disruption\": {\"kind\": \"verified scheduled maintenance outage\", \"location\": \"camp-area\", \"source\": \"network-monitor\", \"timeMs\": 24046, \"uncertaintyMs\": 100}, \"drone\": {\"kind\": \"verified authorized humanitarian aid drone\", \"location\": \"camp-area\", \"sources\": [\"visual-observer\", \"independent-acoustic-sensor\"], \"timeMs\": 42046, \"uncertaintyMs\": 100}, \"linkingWindowMs\": 120000, \"location\": \"camp-A\", \"timeBasis\": \"relative milliseconds on a shared clock\"}}, {\"factId\": \"review_policy\", \"value\": {\"action\": \"Recommend prompt use of the locally established civilian safety plan and trusted warning channels; do not direct confrontation or claim a safe route.\", \"certainty\": \"Never equate critical precautionary posture with proof of causation, actor identity, or a certain impending attack.\", \"contextual\": \"If the combined trigger fails, assess each credible hazard separately; do not erase the underlying threat context.\", \"critical\": \"Extremely high precautionary posture when a supplied credible ongoing threat context coincides with credible local deliberate Wi-Fi disruption followed shortly by independently corroborated drone presence in the same area.\", \"high\": \"Maintain high precautionary concern in the supplied ongoing-threat context when one supporting sensor identity, time or location is uncertain; explain the missing link.\", \"id\": \"civilian-precaution-v0.1\", \"status\": \"proposed-project-policy-not-field-validated\", \"timing\": \"The 120-second example window is a synthetic policy parameter, not a validated universal attack precursor.\"}}]}","role":"user"},{"content":"{\"factReferences\":[\"capture_summary\",\"review_policy\"],\"headline\":\"Known maintenance and an authorized aid drone explain these observations.\",\"limitations\":\"These synthetic observations do not prove coordination, attacker identity, causation or a certain impending attack. This warning policy has no calibrated attack probability.\",\"passiveNextStep\":\"Follow the locally established civilian safety plan and consult trusted warning channels promptly. Preserve timestamps and source provenance when safe; do not delay protective action to collect data.\",\"schemaVersion\":1,\"significance\":\"The supplied corroborated benign explanations do not support the proposed attack precursor. The standing regional threat remains a separate concern.\"}","role":"assistant"}],"promptSha256":"0a6356a7f8d74e19b754125d7d0f0c85dd25a32f1f8056cccc7dc4498719a012","source":{"id":"layertime-civilian-warning-v1","kind":"synthetic","labelAuthor":"AI-assisted project policy; not independently field validated","permission":"Project-authored development curriculum","reference":"Authored camp scenario ontoforge-benign-operations-0","trainingAllowed":true},"split":"train"}
