nnels promptly. Preserve timestamps and source provenance when safe; do not delay protective action to collect data.\",\"schemaVersion\":1,\"significance\":\"The supplied corroborated benign explanations do not support the proposed attack precursor. The standing regional threat remains a separate concern.\"}","role":"assistant"}],"promptSha256":"4f31c104e0553edbdfeccb5f5f4bd593d0a3335726650531d4c72c777f06e559","source":{"id":"layertime-civilian-warning-v1","kind":"synthetic","labelAuthor":"AI-assisted project policy; not independently field validated","permission":"Project-authored development curriculum","reference":"Authored camp scenario ontoforge-benign-operations-1","trainingAllowed":true},"split":"train"}
