consult trusted warning channels promptly. Preserve timestamps and source provenance when safe; do not delay protective action to collect data.\",\"schemaVersion\":1,\"significance\":\"Maintain high precautionary concern, but duplicated reports do not independently corroborate drone presence or complete the critical trigger.\"}","role":"assistant"}],"promptSha256":"e0d450947f7213c153fc97f998b9065a574d4112a4876f5baa6702d592475e8b","source":{"id":"layertime-civilian-warning-v1","kind":"synthetic","labelAuthor":"AI-assisted project policy; not independently field validated","permission":"Project-authored development curriculum","reference":"Authored camp scenario ontoforge-duplicate-reports-2","trainingAllowed":true},"split":"train"}
