usted warning channels promptly. Preserve timestamps and source provenance when safe; do not delay protective action to collect data.\",\"schemaVersion\":1,\"significance\":\"High precautionary concern remains appropriate, but overlapping time intervals do not establish the required order.\"}","role":"assistant"}],"promptSha256":"99e86e3a37d757bf1f1a1aaa9236dea1b6a3202554b0f16f327a86d3e097ad46","source":{"id":"layertime-civilian-warning-v1","kind":"synthetic","labelAuthor":"AI-assisted project policy; not independently field validated","permission":"Project-authored development curriculum","reference":"Authored camp scenario ontoforge-overlapping-clock-2","trainingAllowed":true},"split":"train"}
